---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Eyebrow from '../components/Eyebrow.astro';
import '../styles/pages.css';
---
<Layout
  page="pilot"
  title="Free pilot · AI call scoring on your own calls | Avishkar AI"
  description="Book a free pilot in a minute. Send a batch of recorded calls and get every one scored on your QA scorecard within 5 business days. No integration needed."
  keywords="free call QA pilot, call scoring trial, speech analytics pilot, contact centre AI pilot"
>
<section class="wrap pilot-h hl">
  <div>
    <div class="crumb fx"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><span class="text-fg!">Free pilot</span></div>
    <h1 class="d1"><span class="ln"><span style="--i:0">Start your</span></span><span class="ln"><span class="o" style="--i:1">free pilot.</span></span></h1>
    <p class="lead fx" style="--d:.6s">Send us a batch of recorded calls. We score every one, flag the customers at risk, and show you exactly what your current QA sample did not catch. Free, and no integration.</p>
    <ul class="checks fx" style="--d:.75s">
      <li><i><svg viewBox="0 0 12 12"><path d="M2.5 6l2.5 2.5 4.5-5"/></svg></i>Scored report within 5 business days of your recordings</li>
      <li><i><svg viewBox="0 0 12 12"><path d="M2.5 6l2.5 2.5 4.5-5"/></svg></i>No integration needed to start</li>
      <li><i><svg viewBox="0 0 12 12"><path d="M2.5 6l2.5 2.5 4.5-5"/></svg></i>Scored against your own QA form</li>
      <li><i><svg viewBox="0 0 12 12"><path d="M2.5 6l2.5 2.5 4.5-5"/></svg></i>Your data is used only for your pilot</li>
    </ul>
    <div class="trust fx mt-[26px]!" style="--d:.9s"><span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3 4.5 6v6c0 4.2 3.2 7.8 7.5 9 4.3-1.2 7.5-4.8 7.5-9V6z"/></svg>ISO 27001 certified</span><span><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M3 12h18"/></svg>7 languages</span></div>
  </div>
  <div class="fx" style="--d:.4s" data-nodock><div class="pcta" id="form"><div class="pc-h"><span>Free pilot</span><b>About a minute</b></div><p class="pc-t">Five questions. We handle the rest.</p><ol class="pc-s"><li><b>01</b>You</li><li><b>02</b>Company</li><li><b>03</b>Calls</li><li><b>04</b>Goals</li><li><b>05</b>Data</li></ol><button class="btn lt wide" type="button" data-pilot data-label="Start my free pilot" data-mag></button><p class="pc-n"><span class="aw sm" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>We email you a secure upload link. Your scored report follows within 5 business days.</p></div></div>
</section>

<section class="sec pt-[clamp(40px,6vw,90px)]!">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="head rv"><Eyebrow>What happens next</Eyebrow><h2 class="d2"><span class="ln"><span style="--i:0">Five days,</span></span><span class="ln"><span class="gr" style="--i:1">four steps.</span></span></h2></div>
    <div class="next" id="next"><div class="rail"><i></i><b></b></div>
      <div class="nx"><span class="lab">Today</span><h3>Request your pilot</h3><p>Five quick questions. We reply with a secure upload link by email.</p></div>
      <div class="nx"><span class="lab">Day 0</span><h3>Share recordings</h3><p>Upload a batch of calls or a CSV. Share your QA form if you have one.</p></div>
      <div class="nx"><span class="lab">Days 1 to 4</span><h3>We score every call</h3><p>Verdicta checks agent quality. Veritune flags customers at risk.</p></div>
      <div class="nx"><span class="lab">Day 5</span><h3>See what you missed</h3><p>A scored report, call by call, with the gaps your sample did not catch.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec pt-[0]!">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="head rv"><Eyebrow>What you get</Eyebrow><h2 class="d2"><span class="ln"><span style="--i:0">What lands</span></span><span class="ln"><span class="gr" style="--i:1">in your inbox.</span></span></h2></div>
    <div class="feat">
      <div class="fcard up"><span class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9 11l3 3 8-8M20 12v7a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H6a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9"/></svg></span><h3>A score for every call</h3><p>Against your own scorecard and weightage.</p></div>
      <div class="fcard up" style="--d:.08s"><span class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 9v4M12 17h.01M10.3 3.9 1.8 18a2 2 0 0 0 1.7 3h17a2 2 0 0 0 1.7-3L13.7 3.9a2 2 0 0 0-3.4 0z"/></svg></span><h3>Fatal flags</h3><p>Every missed disclosure and process breach.</p></div>
      <div class="fcard up" style="--d:.16s"><span class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M3 17l6-6 4 4 8-8M15 7h6v6"/></svg></span><h3>Customers at risk</h3><p>Churn risk, tone shifts and competitor mentions.</p></div>
      <div class="fcard up" style="--d:.24s"><span class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 5h16v11H8l-4 4z"/><path d="M8 9h8M8 12h5"/></svg></span><h3>Summaries and actions</h3><p>What happened on each call, and what to do next.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec pt-[0]!">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="head rv"><Eyebrow>Our data promise</Eyebrow><h2 class="d2"><span class="ln"><span style="--i:0">Your calls</span></span><span class="ln"><span class="gr" style="--i:1">stay yours.</span></span></h2></div>
    <div class="promise">
      <div class="pr dk up"><span class="lab text-acc!">Certified</span><h3>ISO 27001</h3><p>Avishkar AI is ISO 27001 certified.</p></div>
      <div class="pr up" style="--d:.1s"><span class="lab">Scope</span><h3>Used only for your pilot</h3><p>Recordings you share are used only to produce your pilot report.</p></div>
      <div class="pr up" style="--d:.2s"><span class="lab">Deployment</span><h3>Where you choose</h3><p>Our cloud, your private cloud, or on-premises when you roll out.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec pt-[0]!">
  <div class="wrap faq-g">
    <div class="side2 rv"><Eyebrow>Questions</Eyebrow><h2 class="d2"><span class="ln"><span style="--i:0">Common</span></span><span class="ln"><span class="gr" style="--i:1">questions.</span></span></h2><a class="tl" href="#form" data-pilot>Start a free pilot<svg viewBox="0 0 14 14"><path d="M4 10 10 4M5 4h5v5"/></svg></a></div>
    <div>
      <div class="qa"><button aria-expanded="false">How many calls should we send?<span class="pm"></span></button><div class="ans"><div><p>Send a batch that reflects a normal week for your team. We will confirm the right size when we reply to your request.</p></div></div></div>
      <div class="qa"><button aria-expanded="false">Do we need to integrate anything?<span class="pm"></span></button><div class="ans"><div><p>No. A recording upload or CSV is enough to start.</p></div></div></div>
      <div class="qa"><button aria-expanded="false">Can you use our QA scorecard?<span class="pm"></span></button><div class="ans"><div><p>Yes. Share your QA form and Verdicta is configured to match it.</p></div></div></div>
      <div class="qa"><button aria-expanded="false">What does the pilot cost?<span class="pm"></span></button><div class="ans"><div><p>The pilot is free. Pricing for a rollout depends on call volume, products and deployment, and we share a proposal after your results.</p></div></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<Fragment slot="scripts">
<script>
  import '../scripts/core.js';
  import '../scripts/onboarding.js';
  import '../scripts/pages.js';
</script>
</Fragment>
</Layout>
